WEBVTT

01:49.880 --> 01:53.360
WUYIN CHONG, SECRET ENVOY OF TIEMO

02:01.800 --> 02:03.320
This must be Chen Valley.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.120
Yes.

02:07.080 --> 02:10.479
Do you know Chen Valley has another name?

02:10.560 --> 02:11.960
Mingshanzi Gorge.

02:12.480 --> 02:14.880
It is what we, the Tiemo people, call it.

02:15.680 --> 02:16.520
That's right.

02:17.200 --> 02:19.040
This piece of land,

02:19.640 --> 02:21.440
170 li south of Mingshanzi,

02:21.520 --> 02:23.120
used to be ours.

02:23.200 --> 02:26.680
If Yan Fengshan is willing
to give us this piece of land,

02:26.760 --> 02:28.960
I'm willing to muster my troops

02:29.040 --> 02:30.440
and crush the Baiwenhu Army.

02:30.520 --> 02:31.680
When the time comes,

02:32.200 --> 02:34.200
I hope you can grant me a small residence.

02:35.520 --> 02:37.680
My ancestors were from Chang'an.

02:37.760 --> 02:39.800
They lived in a small village just ahead.

02:40.400 --> 02:42.160
Later, they moved north to this place

02:42.680 --> 02:44.000
and lived here for 70 years.

02:45.480 --> 02:46.840
The hill behind the village

02:48.160 --> 02:49.840
is where my wife's grave lies.

02:50.560 --> 02:51.920
Do you ask only for a small residence?

02:52.000 --> 02:52.960
Nothing else?

02:53.560 --> 02:56.320
It's best on a hill that faces the sun.

02:57.520 --> 02:58.360
Why?

02:58.440 --> 03:00.560
A hill that faces the sun

03:01.640 --> 03:03.280
is full of white camellias.

03:03.880 --> 03:05.480
It was also

03:06.160 --> 03:07.520
my wife's favorite flower.

03:11.200 --> 03:13.520
Genghui, you are a man with many stories.

03:14.920 --> 03:18.040
If you hadn't accompanied me on this trip,

03:18.120 --> 03:19.240
I'd have been bored.

03:19.880 --> 03:21.200
To accommodate your request,

03:21.720 --> 03:23.600
the person welcoming you

03:23.680 --> 03:26.040
has arranged a musician for you.

03:27.440 --> 03:28.800
Having music to accompany you

03:29.400 --> 03:31.000
is better than having me,

03:31.520 --> 03:34.240
a middle-aged man, with sad stories.

03:36.400 --> 03:37.680
Stop!

03:43.440 --> 03:44.560
Mr. Wuyin,

03:44.640 --> 03:45.760
why are we stopping here?

03:46.600 --> 03:47.960
Twenty-five years ago,

03:48.040 --> 03:50.920
a man wielding a knife
walked out of this granary.

03:51.000 --> 03:53.480
He was a prisoner of war of Tiemo

03:53.560 --> 03:56.800
but he is now ruling Chang'an.

03:56.880 --> 03:58.720
There are ups and downs in life.

03:58.800 --> 04:00.280
It's really unpredictable.

04:01.000 --> 04:03.720
It's almost a historical site
by this point.

04:04.600 --> 04:05.840
Since we're passing by,

04:05.920 --> 04:07.160
let's just take a look.

04:08.560 --> 04:09.520
Legend has it

04:09.600 --> 04:12.760
that General Fengshan can strike fear
into both gods and ghosts.

04:13.960 --> 04:15.720
I want to meet

04:16.240 --> 04:17.320
a man like him too.

04:23.560 --> 04:24.960
Greetings, Mr. Wuyin.

04:25.040 --> 04:26.920
Since you are here,

04:27.000 --> 04:29.200
I will bring the musician here as well.

04:29.800 --> 04:30.720
This way, please.

04:51.960 --> 04:53.600
GU

04:56.520 --> 04:58.880
Mr. Wuyin, your reception
and trip to Chang'an

04:59.480 --> 05:01.400
are all attended by my master,

05:01.480 --> 05:03.160
Yang Chuhao.

05:03.920 --> 05:05.880
He knows you like guqin music,

05:05.960 --> 05:09.560
so my master went through 700 musicians

05:10.240 --> 05:12.200
and finally sent her here.

05:13.360 --> 05:14.680
She is but a bondservant.

05:18.120 --> 05:19.920
I hear Yang Chuhao is rich.

05:20.000 --> 05:21.960
His wealth could rival half of Chang'an.

05:22.560 --> 05:23.800
Is someone like him

05:23.880 --> 05:25.160
part of the Huben Army too?

05:26.600 --> 05:29.560
Yes. The Huben Army is everywhere.

05:29.640 --> 05:32.960
That is why we can
gain control of Chang'an.

05:43.600 --> 05:45.880
Your guqin skills are the best
among 700 people.

05:45.960 --> 05:47.320
Play a song for me, then.

05:48.880 --> 05:49.720
Yes.

06:59.920 --> 07:01.480
Why did you play this song?

07:02.360 --> 07:03.560
It's full of killing intent.

07:04.160 --> 07:05.280
There's blood on the walls.

07:07.400 --> 07:09.160
It's obvious that many people died here.

07:10.200 --> 07:12.520
If you want me
to play a decadent song for you,

07:13.560 --> 07:14.520
I can't do it.

07:16.200 --> 07:17.520
Since you've met me today,

07:18.040 --> 07:20.200
you will no longer be a slave.

07:23.160 --> 07:25.240
To make a girl
of such guqin skill a slave,

07:25.840 --> 07:27.640
Yang Chuhao does know
how to appreciate talents.

07:28.920 --> 07:30.080
That's…

07:41.000 --> 07:42.440
Come with me.

07:42.520 --> 07:44.720
Once we're in Chang'an,
I'll help you teach him a lesson.

07:50.240 --> 07:51.320
Thank you, sir.

08:31.360 --> 08:32.200
Thank you.

08:33.240 --> 08:34.320
Thank you, Eunuch.

08:36.159 --> 08:37.320
You are the only one

08:39.440 --> 08:41.080
who will send food to me.

08:42.000 --> 08:43.880
I only stole two buns.

08:45.920 --> 08:46.880
Next time,

08:48.000 --> 08:49.800
I shall bring you Golden Milk Pastry.

08:50.520 --> 08:52.200
Yan Fengshan doesn't live in the palace

08:52.880 --> 08:55.040
and the young emperor doesn't eat much.

08:55.120 --> 08:58.080
The cooks in the imperial kitchen
have nothing to do.

08:58.160 --> 08:59.840
They cook their own food

09:00.520 --> 09:02.400
and have many delicacies.

09:02.920 --> 09:04.720
It's all right.

09:06.400 --> 09:07.880
Buns are filling.

09:10.800 --> 09:13.040
It'll be Chou hour soon.

09:14.440 --> 09:15.760
I have to collect the memorials

09:16.760 --> 09:18.680
and send them to Emperor Yan.

09:19.960 --> 09:22.040
Yan Fengshan is truly…

09:26.960 --> 09:28.680
a formidable commander.

09:31.960 --> 09:33.520
When you deliver memorials
to him every day,

09:33.600 --> 09:36.720
Chancellor, you still
get to leave the palace.

09:37.480 --> 09:39.240
Unlike us, the eunuchs,

09:39.320 --> 09:42.520
we are trapped in these palace walls

09:43.040 --> 09:44.600
and grow old inside the palace.

12:40.080 --> 12:43.800
I'M STILL ALIVE.

14:02.440 --> 14:05.200
I'M STILL ALIVE.

14:26.720 --> 14:28.320
Tofu!

14:28.400 --> 14:29.480
Tofu!

14:29.560 --> 14:32.880
Miss, come buy a piece of tofu.

14:37.880 --> 14:39.600
WONTON SHOP

14:39.680 --> 14:42.200
Sha! Get me a bowl of wontons

14:42.280 --> 14:44.200
and another sugary pastry.

14:52.920 --> 14:54.640
You have a good appetite today, Boss.

14:55.560 --> 14:56.600
Good appetite? Nonsense.

14:57.360 --> 14:58.680
YANG CHUHAO

14:58.760 --> 14:59.920
I'm troubled.

15:02.400 --> 15:04.400
No matter what, I still have to eat

15:05.520 --> 15:07.880
so that I have the energy
to continue sulking.

15:09.840 --> 15:10.720
You…

15:22.920 --> 15:24.120
White Hair.

15:27.840 --> 15:28.920
Mr. Yang.

15:29.920 --> 15:31.560
We've not seen each other for 15 years

15:33.480 --> 15:35.240
yet you still recognize me.

15:45.520 --> 15:46.880
I will never forget

15:48.360 --> 15:49.960
that gaze of yours.

16:09.600 --> 16:10.600
Sha.

16:12.080 --> 16:13.000
Did you kill him?

16:13.720 --> 16:15.360
Even as a white-haired ghost,

16:19.600 --> 16:21.440
I'm not here just to kill.

16:31.960 --> 16:32.920
Come.

16:37.680 --> 16:38.760
People may see us.

16:39.600 --> 16:40.520
Let's talk inside.

16:50.960 --> 16:52.480
Boss, what's wrong?

16:53.000 --> 16:54.040
Sha,

16:54.120 --> 16:55.120
go out.

16:55.720 --> 16:57.440
You won't be doing any business today.

16:57.520 --> 16:59.520
-I'm still cooking…
-Hurry.

17:02.440 --> 17:04.640
All right. It's your business anyway.

17:19.280 --> 17:21.359
I've completed what was mentioned

17:22.560 --> 17:23.640
in your letter previously.

17:24.920 --> 17:26.040
That girl

17:26.119 --> 17:28.119
has blended with the Tiemo envoys.

17:29.200 --> 17:33.320
I thought I had already paid
all my debts to your family.

17:34.600 --> 17:35.880
I didn't expect

17:36.400 --> 17:38.160
you to come here

17:38.240 --> 17:40.280
and collect the debt in person.

17:45.080 --> 17:46.720
After my family was annihilated,

17:48.080 --> 17:49.760
Yan Fengshan tried to wipe out
the remnants of my family.

17:51.040 --> 17:52.320
At least 3,000 people

17:52.840 --> 17:54.840
died in Chang'an.

17:55.880 --> 17:59.280
Countless families were broken apart.

18:01.400 --> 18:02.400
Mr. Yang,

18:03.200 --> 18:04.880
you survived

18:05.840 --> 18:07.880
and have done exceptionally well.

18:08.480 --> 18:10.640
You even became Yan Fengshan's moneybag.

18:15.480 --> 18:18.320
As an esteemed guest of General Fengshan,

18:19.840 --> 18:21.760
do you think you've cleared your debt

18:24.680 --> 18:26.000
compared to those who died?

18:45.560 --> 18:47.440
I still need to live

18:47.520 --> 18:50.720
and I still need to do business.

18:50.800 --> 18:55.200
Do you want me to live my whole life

18:55.720 --> 18:56.840
indebted to your family?

18:59.240 --> 19:00.920
It's not a debt.

19:02.200 --> 19:03.920
There are too many secrets

19:04.800 --> 19:07.800
in the 30 letters
you and my father sent each other

19:09.040 --> 19:10.640
for ten years.

19:12.160 --> 19:14.120
Hidden Soldier Alley, Cangshui River,

19:14.640 --> 19:18.160
and the blueprints you and my father
designed for the imperial dynasty.

19:19.680 --> 19:21.960
Even Yan Fengshan
might not know about that.

19:27.400 --> 19:28.360
TO LIU ZIWEN

19:28.440 --> 19:29.320
This is evidence

19:31.080 --> 19:33.200
of you being a part
of my family's faction.

19:38.040 --> 19:39.280
Mr. Yang,

19:41.120 --> 19:42.600
this is just one of the letters.

20:15.120 --> 20:16.000
You…

20:23.960 --> 20:25.040
Yes.

20:26.720 --> 20:29.080
I am a close friend of your father's.

20:29.600 --> 20:30.600
That's true.

20:30.680 --> 20:34.680
But I've done a lot for the Huben Army too

20:35.200 --> 20:36.760
by running a business for them.

20:37.360 --> 20:40.880
All my money is earned with hard work.

20:47.320 --> 20:49.120
If I want you to go down with me

20:49.920 --> 20:52.320
and tell Yan Fengshan the truth,

20:55.280 --> 20:58.080
who do you think will die first

21:00.560 --> 21:02.000
between the two of us?

21:23.480 --> 21:24.600
Try it.

21:27.600 --> 21:30.040
They've pursued me for more than a decade.

21:33.520 --> 21:35.440
I was stabbed and beaten.

21:38.280 --> 21:40.400
Even my last family member is dead.

21:43.040 --> 21:44.800
Do you think I'd be afraid?

21:45.920 --> 21:48.280
Yang Chuhao, you have a family
and a huge business.

21:49.760 --> 21:51.240
Can you afford to lose?

21:51.920 --> 21:53.480
Do you dare to lose?

22:05.560 --> 22:06.960
Speak.

22:11.520 --> 22:12.480
Tell me.

22:13.760 --> 22:15.200
What else do you want me to do?

22:22.160 --> 22:25.160
The Tiemo envoys
will enter the Capital in secret.

22:26.440 --> 22:27.680
Three days later,

22:28.320 --> 22:29.720
they will enter Jinguang Gate at night

22:30.560 --> 22:33.000
and meet Yan Fengshan
at the courtyard of Yankang Ward.

22:34.080 --> 22:35.480
Purchase Huaiyuan Ward

22:35.560 --> 22:38.280
and the street
right next to Chonghua Ward.

22:38.360 --> 22:41.680
I have something to do over there.

22:42.640 --> 22:43.560
Remember.

22:43.640 --> 22:46.520
The most important thing is
that no one can be around there.

22:53.080 --> 22:54.720
When I'm done, what's next?

22:56.240 --> 22:58.840
You'll give me
something else to do, right?

23:01.480 --> 23:03.640
I serve Yan Fengshan.

23:04.160 --> 23:05.520
Each favor

23:05.600 --> 23:09.200
I grant you may cost me my life.

23:10.320 --> 23:11.960
Will it ever end?

23:15.880 --> 23:19.400
Sha has run this eatery for 20 years.

23:20.640 --> 23:22.040
On the surface,

23:22.960 --> 23:24.720
it's just a place to eat wontons.

23:25.320 --> 23:26.400
In truth,

23:27.280 --> 23:29.840
this was where my father
used to meet you in secret.

23:31.000 --> 23:33.960
Sha was also a part
of my family's faction.

23:35.240 --> 23:36.360
Mr. Yang,

23:36.440 --> 23:39.600
you have always protected him.

23:39.680 --> 23:43.960
I see you are still someone
who cherishes old ties.

23:58.440 --> 23:59.840
I don't want those

24:00.760 --> 24:01.960
who cherish old ties to die.

24:02.720 --> 24:04.040
I'll count on you

24:04.120 --> 24:06.040
for what comes next, Mr. Yang.

24:32.360 --> 24:33.640
Thank you, sir.

24:33.720 --> 24:35.160
-Take care.
-Sure.

24:39.360 --> 24:40.280
Mr. Zhou!

24:41.240 --> 24:42.480
NOODLE BOWLS

24:42.560 --> 24:44.760
Su, give my warm regards to your boss.

24:45.280 --> 24:47.240
You've worked hard, Mr. Zhou.
The boss is doing well.

24:47.320 --> 24:49.120
He asked you to take care.

24:49.200 --> 24:51.680
You can only make money for him
when you are healthy.

24:51.760 --> 24:52.960
Help me thank him.

24:54.600 --> 24:55.560
Mr. Qi.

24:56.640 --> 24:58.440
-See you again next month.
-Sure.

24:58.520 --> 24:59.680
It's all thanks to you.

25:02.520 --> 25:04.200
Mr. Song! I'm here again!

25:06.880 --> 25:08.480
-I've prepared everything for you.
-Sure.

25:09.000 --> 25:09.840
-No problem.
-All right.

25:09.920 --> 25:10.760
I'm leaving.

25:10.840 --> 25:12.520
-Here you go.
-Have you been waiting for me?

25:12.600 --> 25:14.400
-I hope you're not paying less this month.
-Not at all.

25:14.480 --> 25:15.960
See you next month.

25:16.040 --> 25:17.480
-Thank you, sir.
-Take care.

25:22.280 --> 25:25.320
TAIYIJI CLINIC

25:36.160 --> 25:38.640
The sound of the abacus is nice.

25:39.840 --> 25:41.560
It's comfortable listening to it.

25:41.640 --> 25:43.840
It makes me sleepy.

25:43.920 --> 25:44.840
Is that so?

25:44.920 --> 25:46.240
How is it different from the usual kind?

25:46.840 --> 25:47.920
There's a huge difference.

25:48.520 --> 25:50.240
Normally, we need
to make the calculations.

25:50.320 --> 25:52.080
I get headaches whenever I calculate.

25:52.800 --> 25:53.680
You are right.

25:59.280 --> 26:00.800
What are you doing?

26:03.280 --> 26:04.880
You're back. I'm checking the ledger.

26:05.600 --> 26:06.840
It's a bit of a mess,

26:06.920 --> 26:08.040
so I'm sorting the accounts.

26:08.120 --> 26:08.960
I'll be done soon.

26:11.200 --> 26:13.240
Then, have you checked the inventory?

26:13.320 --> 26:15.640
Have you swept the floor?

26:15.720 --> 26:17.320
I checked the inventory

26:17.400 --> 26:18.480
and I swept the shop.

26:18.560 --> 26:20.040
I'm used to doing all this.

26:20.120 --> 26:21.920
I even cleaned the corners. Don't worry.

26:23.200 --> 26:24.520
Mr. Su, you are so nice.

26:24.600 --> 26:26.320
You are so enthusiastic.

26:28.640 --> 26:29.600
That's right.

26:29.680 --> 26:32.440
I remember you are our creditor.

26:33.720 --> 26:36.120
You two are letting our creditor
check stock and books.

26:36.200 --> 26:38.120
Are you two out of your minds?

26:40.640 --> 26:43.000
Why are you spacing out? Get him out!

26:44.480 --> 26:45.320
Hurry up!

26:45.400 --> 26:46.680
-Let's go.
-I'm not done with the accounts.

26:46.760 --> 26:47.640
Go out quickly.

26:49.680 --> 26:51.360
Miss Shen!

26:51.880 --> 26:52.960
Listen to me!

26:54.600 --> 26:56.600
You are really interesting.

26:56.680 --> 26:59.360
People collect debts
by splashing red paint or releasing mice,

26:59.440 --> 27:02.280
yet you come and work
at my shop every day.

27:03.520 --> 27:05.120
You won't come and see me
even when I'm here,

27:06.000 --> 27:07.480
and I have nothing to do there.

27:09.600 --> 27:10.960
Forget about all that.

27:11.040 --> 27:13.360
You were really daring today
and even touched my ledger.

27:13.440 --> 27:14.600
What are you planning to do?

27:14.680 --> 27:16.600
I was only trying to help you.

27:16.680 --> 27:19.720
Last time, you said the ledger was a mess.

27:19.800 --> 27:22.400
That was an excuse I used to not pay you.

27:23.560 --> 27:24.560
Stop coming here to annoy me.

27:24.640 --> 27:26.120
I'll pay you when I have the money.

27:26.640 --> 27:28.440
If you clear your debt,

27:29.160 --> 27:30.600
can I still come here?

27:40.160 --> 27:41.880
BLESSINGS ABOUND

27:41.960 --> 27:43.680
MISFORTUNE FADES

28:07.280 --> 28:08.680
There's something

28:09.960 --> 28:10.960
in your eyes.

28:16.480 --> 28:19.200
Do you fancy something valuable
in my shop?

28:19.280 --> 28:20.440
I…

28:22.160 --> 28:23.280
Listen.

28:23.880 --> 28:25.160
You will meet no good end

28:26.000 --> 28:27.400
meddling with folk like me.

28:29.960 --> 28:30.960
You should leave at once.

28:31.040 --> 28:32.200
Farewell.

28:32.840 --> 28:33.680
I…

28:57.320 --> 29:01.280
TAIYIJI CLINIC

29:05.720 --> 29:06.560
Miss Shen.

29:06.640 --> 29:08.160
You're still here?

29:12.880 --> 29:13.760
Huai'an.

29:22.800 --> 29:23.880
Are you all right?

29:25.800 --> 29:26.800
I'm fine.

29:30.080 --> 29:31.400
Everyone is still alive.

29:32.840 --> 29:33.880
Even the pageboy survived.

29:36.520 --> 29:37.560
That's great.

29:38.800 --> 29:39.880
That's great.

30:09.280 --> 30:10.200
Boss!

30:11.000 --> 30:12.040
I'm back!

30:15.120 --> 30:16.680
These are the ledgers for this month.

30:17.200 --> 30:19.040
-Good.
-I've collected them all.

30:19.680 --> 30:20.600
Here you go.

30:36.040 --> 30:38.600
The account for the silk shop is wrong.

30:39.720 --> 30:40.600
Look.

30:41.400 --> 30:43.640
Last month's remaining stock was 70 bolts.

30:44.160 --> 30:46.440
This month, 130 bolts were brought in.

30:46.520 --> 30:49.440
One hundred ten bolts were sold.
Twenty bolts are remaining.

30:49.520 --> 30:51.720
The cumulative balance is 90 bolts.

30:51.800 --> 30:52.680
However,

30:52.760 --> 30:55.480
the number of bolts
doesn't match your money.

31:09.400 --> 31:10.920
The account is right.

31:13.240 --> 31:14.280
Boss,

31:16.400 --> 31:17.400
you were trying to fool me.

31:22.520 --> 31:23.560
If I didn't do that,

31:24.360 --> 31:27.840
how would I know
if you were paying attention?

31:31.520 --> 31:32.720
I'm devoted

31:33.480 --> 31:35.080
to serving you.

31:35.160 --> 31:36.160
You are lying.

31:36.880 --> 31:38.600
I've been observing you
for quite some time.

31:39.600 --> 31:41.640
Something in your eyes
tells me there's a problem.

31:42.920 --> 31:43.880
Is it because of money?

31:44.800 --> 31:45.960
No.

31:46.760 --> 31:48.600
You pay me well.

31:50.440 --> 31:52.440
Then, it must be because of a woman.

31:58.800 --> 31:59.720
Which woman is it?

32:05.760 --> 32:09.200
She runs the clinic on Xiaocaomen Street.

32:11.400 --> 32:12.680
Xiaocao…

32:14.120 --> 32:14.960
All right.

32:15.040 --> 32:16.880
Take me there to take a look.

32:16.960 --> 32:18.040
Let me see if she suits you.

32:18.120 --> 32:18.960
Please don't do that.

32:19.040 --> 32:21.080
-You'll be chased out.
-What?

32:21.600 --> 32:23.800
She would chase even me out?

32:26.120 --> 32:28.480
Half of the shops
on Xiaocaomen Street belong to me.

32:28.560 --> 32:30.160
She doesn't care who you are.

32:30.240 --> 32:32.280
She will chase anyone
she dislikes out of her shop.

32:34.000 --> 32:35.400
A fiery lady.

32:38.240 --> 32:40.080
All right. Starting next month,

32:40.160 --> 32:41.440
I will increase your salary.

32:41.520 --> 32:44.960
Let's save up a larger amount
for the betrothal gift.

32:45.040 --> 32:45.880
What do you think?

32:47.920 --> 32:49.240
We aren't that close yet.

33:13.680 --> 33:14.920
I can also tell that something

33:17.040 --> 33:17.880
is troubling you, Boss.

33:29.960 --> 33:31.080
Is it related to money?

33:32.280 --> 33:34.760
Do you think I have a problem
if it's related to money?

33:39.920 --> 33:41.040
Then, it must be a woman.

33:41.720 --> 33:43.040
Not a woman,

33:44.080 --> 33:45.680
but a man.

33:46.200 --> 33:47.160
A man?

33:50.000 --> 33:51.000
Boss.

33:52.040 --> 33:53.040
Don't do this.

33:53.600 --> 33:56.320
Nonsense! What were you thinking?

33:57.520 --> 33:59.920
He's the son of a former friend.

34:00.000 --> 34:01.240
He's here to collect a debt.

34:01.320 --> 34:02.800
That's not a problem.

34:02.880 --> 34:04.600
We have a lot of money in the treasury.

34:04.680 --> 34:07.000
He's here to collect a debt of life.

34:17.480 --> 34:18.679
Speaking of which,

34:19.199 --> 34:22.040
that man just now looked honest.

34:23.520 --> 34:24.600
We've not met for a few months

34:24.679 --> 34:26.719
and you're acting like a matchmaker now?

34:27.880 --> 34:29.159
If you have no feelings for him,

34:29.239 --> 34:32.159
why did you keep testing him?

34:35.239 --> 34:36.800
I don't know what you mean.

34:38.639 --> 34:40.360
With your wealth,

34:40.440 --> 34:42.440
you can even purchase
half of the street's shops.

34:43.320 --> 34:44.920
Why borrow money from him then?

34:45.440 --> 34:48.639
I think you are
purposely testing his patience.

34:51.360 --> 34:52.560
Don't expose me.

34:52.639 --> 34:54.920
How can I still show myself in the future?

34:58.840 --> 35:02.400
Huai'an, what are your plans
after coming back?

35:10.800 --> 35:12.840
Yan Fengshan is meeting the Tiemo people.

35:14.360 --> 35:15.800
This is our best chance to strike back.

35:24.640 --> 35:25.960
I saw this

35:26.720 --> 35:28.480
at Hidden Soldier Alley.

35:36.840 --> 35:38.120
It wasn't too long ago

35:39.920 --> 35:41.360
when I entered Hidden Soldier Alley.

35:44.760 --> 35:46.240
When one endures hardship,

35:47.840 --> 35:48.760
life

35:50.160 --> 35:51.240
becomes muddled.

35:53.960 --> 35:55.240
Bai Wan wouldn't want
to see you like this.

35:57.720 --> 35:59.920
Once you settle things in Chang'an,

36:00.560 --> 36:01.920
go to a new place

36:03.320 --> 36:04.320
and start all over again.

36:09.640 --> 36:12.240
Have you found the people
I asked you to find?

36:14.360 --> 36:16.640
I did. Apparently, they moved south.

36:16.720 --> 36:19.800
However, there are many towns
south of Nanwei Trough.

36:19.880 --> 36:21.000
I've sent men to look for them.

36:21.080 --> 36:22.840
We'll know immediately
if there's any news.

36:24.040 --> 36:24.920
All right.

36:27.920 --> 36:29.280
They lost their daughter.

36:30.440 --> 36:31.520
No matter what,

36:33.680 --> 36:35.320
I must give them an explanation.

36:36.760 --> 36:39.880
GLOWING MIST

36:39.960 --> 36:41.160
Yang!

36:43.320 --> 36:45.560
General, why are you here?

36:45.640 --> 36:47.560
I bought two seabass at the market.

36:47.640 --> 36:48.560
They are fresh.

36:48.640 --> 36:50.960
Zhiying is busy today and can't cook

36:51.040 --> 36:54.040
so I decided to come here
to make grilled fish.

36:55.600 --> 36:58.600
Seabass is fatty this season.

36:59.440 --> 37:01.720
Why not steam them?

37:03.480 --> 37:04.600
You have high standards.

37:30.160 --> 37:33.120
Let me taste it for you.

37:43.240 --> 37:47.040
No wonder they say
you should steam seabass in spring.

37:47.560 --> 37:49.080
It's a delicacy indeed.

37:49.800 --> 37:51.440
Those who eat the back of the fish first

37:52.200 --> 37:53.680
are poor people.

37:54.440 --> 37:55.600
Were you poor when you were young?

37:57.840 --> 37:59.000
To be honest,

37:59.800 --> 38:01.920
I was born poor indeed.

38:02.000 --> 38:04.920
Well, how else could I claim
that I started from scratch?

38:06.200 --> 38:07.640
Here. Have this.

38:08.360 --> 38:10.480
General, you take good care of me.

38:17.360 --> 38:18.840
Speaking of which,

38:18.920 --> 38:21.520
do you still remember White Hair?

38:23.640 --> 38:26.840
Are you talking about the son
of the Liu family?

38:28.720 --> 38:31.640
I've not heard this name in many years.

38:32.160 --> 38:35.800
Right now, besides Xiao Wuyang

38:36.680 --> 38:38.200
and the person from Yulong Ridge,

38:39.360 --> 38:42.040
the only one who is worthy
to become my opponent

38:43.800 --> 38:45.040
is White Hair.

38:50.160 --> 38:53.160
General, you rate him so highly.

38:53.800 --> 38:56.560
Is he causing you trouble?

38:57.560 --> 38:59.240
In strategy, I may not match him.

39:02.160 --> 39:04.560
I heard you had former ties
with the Liu family

39:05.160 --> 39:07.560
so I didn't tell you

39:07.640 --> 39:09.520
about some of his doings.

39:10.800 --> 39:13.240
However, I need to give you a reminder.

39:13.320 --> 39:16.200
We will be meeting the Tiemo people soon.

39:16.280 --> 39:19.800
It is crucial and nothing can go wrong.

39:21.120 --> 39:23.360
I think White Hair might appear.

39:23.880 --> 39:26.360
I'm worried that he might pay you a visit.

39:37.760 --> 39:40.920
I… General, this isn't necessary.

39:41.520 --> 39:43.320
He is a vengeful person.

39:43.840 --> 39:46.880
I think you won't be able
to escape from him.

39:49.960 --> 39:52.960
Besides, you don't have
many guards in this residence.

39:53.640 --> 39:57.240
The only person I know
is the kid who collects debts for you.

39:57.840 --> 39:59.920
I don't think he's any help.

40:00.000 --> 40:01.600
Take this.

40:01.680 --> 40:04.080
If he comes to you,
you can use it to defend yourself.

40:04.160 --> 40:05.440
I…

40:06.160 --> 40:07.960
Thank you, General.

40:08.040 --> 40:10.360
Then, I'll keep it for now.

40:15.400 --> 40:17.040
However, I really don't think
it's necessary.

40:17.120 --> 40:19.040
People our age

40:19.920 --> 40:21.560
don't have many friends left.

40:22.160 --> 40:24.840
I hope you can stay safe.

40:30.080 --> 40:31.560
After hearing what you say,

40:32.320 --> 40:34.200
I'll make sure to survive.

40:35.280 --> 40:36.480
I still want

40:37.000 --> 40:40.200
to eat fish and drink wine with you

40:40.720 --> 40:41.840
after 20 years.

40:43.720 --> 40:44.560
All right.

40:45.960 --> 40:47.320
-Come on.
-Cheers.

40:56.440 --> 40:58.320
ALL-GOODS SHOP

41:04.960 --> 41:07.360
Sir. What do you want? Browse on your own.

41:07.880 --> 41:08.960
Sure.

41:09.040 --> 41:10.080
Sir,

41:10.920 --> 41:13.360
there's a plant used for chewing

41:13.880 --> 41:15.160
called Bitter-After.

41:15.680 --> 41:18.040
I've searched many shops
but I couldn't find it.

41:18.120 --> 41:19.520
I wonder if you have it here.

41:20.200 --> 41:22.160
You're in luck today, sir. I have it here.

41:30.760 --> 41:32.040
Sir, please take a look.

41:43.240 --> 41:45.320
-This is it.
-There's no mistake about it.

41:45.400 --> 41:47.480
Few in Chang'an bought it before.

41:47.560 --> 41:49.200
It was too bitter.

41:49.280 --> 41:51.800
Many people have been buying it recently.

41:51.880 --> 41:53.360
You know your stuff.

41:53.440 --> 41:56.360
Buy all of them
and I'll only charge two liang of silver.

41:58.120 --> 41:59.480
I might not be a regular customer

41:59.560 --> 42:02.200
but isn't this too expensive, sir?

42:02.800 --> 42:03.840
Besides,

42:03.920 --> 42:06.440
this can be found everywhere in Tiemo.

42:06.520 --> 42:09.480
It should be cheaper
than the hay used to feed horses.

42:10.200 --> 42:11.400
Sir, it's like this.

42:11.480 --> 42:13.080
Bitter-After was dirt cheap at first,

42:13.160 --> 42:14.440
but these are troubled times.

42:14.520 --> 42:17.760
There might be a war with Tiemo tomorrow.

42:17.840 --> 42:19.880
There's an unstable supply
so it is scarce.

42:19.960 --> 42:22.480
Naturally, the price
has increased as well.

42:24.560 --> 42:26.320
All right. Give me a bundle of it.

42:27.160 --> 42:28.240
Got it.

42:28.320 --> 42:29.960
Is this meant for family or friends?

42:30.680 --> 42:31.600
No.

42:32.360 --> 42:35.760
It is for an old acquaintance
I have been separated from for many years.
